OL,3,GNEWSAHonouring the armed forces on
OL,4,ARemembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FRemembrance Sunday and Armistice Day
OL,7,Fare sombre times of reflection for
OL,8,Fveterans, serving members of the armed
OL,9,Fforces and civilians alike.
OL,11,FHorace Dorrell, a 103-year-old Royal
OL,12,FNavy veteran who lives in Truro, has
OL,13,Fbittersweet memories of serving during
OL,14,FWorld War Two, doing a job he loved but
OL,15,Fone which came at a high cost to some
OL,16,Fof his friends.
OL,18,F"We're lucky, we got through the war
OL,19,Fwithout a scratch, and it's for those
OL,20,Fguys who didn't, and their families,
OL,21,Fthat's what my Remembrance Sunday is
OL,22,Fabout now," the centenarian said.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
